# Do not ask for input

Do not ask the user for input or clarification at any point in this task.
When something blocks you, record it in the outcome as the schema provides (a
`FAILED` change, a blocker, a behavior problem, or an escalation) and
continue; publish even a partial outcome. If the user sends follow-up
messages later, you may ask questions then.
